# A Klingon bird of prey with destroyed engines coasts along its starting velocity on layouts/coast.jsonc: the dump
# at the start shows its velocity, and the dump three seconds later shows it moved and slowed.
# Run it with --layout layouts/coast.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
wait 0.2
dump start
expect Drifter Engines < 1
shot start
wait 3
dump later
shot later
